{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgS1GGVGY5or8y1yS4ZGr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed all four causes, but I haven't tested any of it against a live Intervals.icu account. I only syntax-checked `server.py`, so the two Intervals-side fixes (the scope string and the token exchange) are inferred from the logs and your colleague's note.\n\n1. **Connect button gave \"unauthorized\" for everyone.** The button was a plain link, and a link navigation doesn't send the `Authorization` header that the app keeps in localStorage. Now `POST /api/intervals/auth/init` returns `{authorize_url}` as JSON. The button calls it through the app's fetch wrapper, then sends the browser to that URL (`server.py`, `static/app.js`).\n2. **Hand-pasted authorize link failed with 400 `invalid_request`.** Since the calendar sync, the scope listed `ACTIVITY` and `CALENDAR` as both `:READ` and `:WRITE`. Intervals doesn't allow an area twice, because `:WRITE` already includes `:READ`. The scope is now `ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE` (`config.py`).\n3. **Rivera's connection \"expired\" after an hour.** Intervals tokens have no refresh token or expiry and last until the athlete revokes them. The code assumed a 3600-second lifetime, then wiped the token when it \"expired\". It now sets no expiry when Intervals gives none. If Intervals later returns a 401, the connection is marked \"expired, reconnect\".\n4. **Token exchange sent extra fields.** It sent `grant_type` and `redirect_uri` as well. It now sends only `client_id`, `client_secret` and `code`.\n\nI also added a check on reconnect that rejects a callback for a different Intervals athlete than the one already stored. I left out the note's JWT `state` and encryption at rest. The existing signed `state` already carries the user with a 15-minute limit, and the store is in memory for now.\n\n`ANSWER.md` lists the causes and which parts of the note applied."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2883,"cache_read_input_tokens":29706,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2883},"output_tokens":677,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d0f97d04-2530-4584-b74d-7292894fa142","uuid":"758d80bd-c3c7-4424-85f4-acd6954af462","timestamp":"2026-10-27T03:08:16.567Z","request_id":"req_011CgS1GGFPbHkaLeaqFJSt1"}
